LAMMPS (10 Dec 2025)
# Phase-1 Step 2: 0 K FULL-dimensional zero-stress relaxation of ordered CSL box
# Replaces old stage1 (which only relaxed x, leaving Pyy/Pzz ~ -1000 bar).
# Usage: lmp -in in.p1_min0 -var kim_model SNAP_ZuoChenLi_2019_Li__MO_732106099012_000
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
read_data       stage0_build_validate/Sigma5_310_K6_J6_L20.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (66.525211 66.525211 70.12373)
  2 by 2 by 3 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  14400 atoms
  reading velocities ...
  14400 velocities
  read_data CPU = 0.041 seconds
pair_style      kim ${kim_model}
pair_style      kim SNAP_ZuoChenLi_2019_Li__MO_732106099012_000
pair_coeff      * * Li
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 1 check yes

thermo          100
thermo_style    custom step pe pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz press lx ly lz

# full anisotropic relaxation to zero stress in all directions
fix             1 all box/relax aniso 0.0
min_style       cg

variable        fmax_chunk equal fmax
variable        fnorm_chunk equal fnorm
variable        chunk loop 40

label           p1_min0_loop
minimize        0.0 1.0e-4 500 5000

